(7592401, 1224542, 87808, '<td valign="top">An amazing photo, I just an not getting it though for this challenge.  Would love to hear what it means.  Off to google helicopters to see if I can find a connection. Vote later</td>', 'An amazing photo, I just an not getting it though for this challenge.  Would love to hear what it means.  Off to google helicopters to see if I can find a connection. Vote later', '2018-08-15 11:11:34.000000', NULL, 1),
