(7592406, 1224656, 87808, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot. Very interesting and great pp work with the softness and sharpness working so well together</td>', 'I like this a lot. Very interesting and great pp work with the softness and sharpness working so well together', '2018-08-15 11:14:53.000000', NULL, 1),
