(7592751, 1224543, 87808, '<td valign="top">Fabulous take on this challenge,. Love that you actually got different colours  in the bones and shade of shadows/light/darkness. Very creative!</td>', 'Fabulous take on this challenge,. Love that you actually got different colours  in the bones and shade of shadows/light/darkness. Very creative!', '2018-08-17 01:57:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7592752, 1224657, 87808, '<td valign="top">I love this shot, and was telling my daughter about it. And then showed her.  The first thing she said, was it was fantastic but how she wished the other people where not in it. That was my exact thoughts as well. I know you can not do it for this standard editing, but if you can clone those people out, you will have a shot that would be hung in any dinosaur gallery and people would pay money for it, if this was my shot, i would do it, just so I could hang it on my wall. As it is , it is still a bloody fantastic shot!!</td>', 'I love this shot, and was telling my daughter about it. And then showed her.  The first thing she said, was it was fantastic but how she wished the other people where not in it. That was my exact thoughts as well. I know you can not do it for this standard editing, but if you can clone those people out, you will have a shot that would be hung in any dinosaur gallery and people would pay money for it, if this was my shot, i would do it, just so I could hang it on my wall. As it is , it is still a bloody fantastic shot!!', '2018-08-17 02:01:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7592754, 1224609, 87808, '<td valign="top">A little more light, or brightness in PP, and a dip in the contrast would have made this stand out a little more for me. Nice collection though!</td>', 'A little more light, or brightness in PP, and a dip in the contrast would have made this stand out a little more for me. Nice collection though!', '2018-08-17 02:06:03.000000', NULL, 1),
