(7593498, 1224657, 87808, '<td valign="top">I still adore this shot and told daughter where it placed tonight.  Her response was " Like, well yeeeeah, I told you sooooo, that is great, yaaaay, well done (as any 17.8 hormonal year girl rolls her eyes, with a ton of sarcasm)))<br/> <br/> <b>But</b> then she said "" Did he clone out those people yet, cus our Charlie and other kids would love a print on their wall and he should send a print to the museum as well, they will love it, with or without the people in it" <br/> <br/>This is a hormonal 17.8 year old setting the bar, <u><b>high </b></u> and giving you a 10 star thumbs up!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!! Cherish it!! lol<br/> <br/>Well done Mark, I am an old women and I love dinosaurs, this is a really fabulous photo that tugs at everyone heartstrings.</td>', 'I still adore this shot and told daughter where it placed tonight.  Her response was " Like, well yeeeeah, I told you sooooo, that is great, yaaaay, well done (as any 17.8 hormonal year girl rolls her eyes, with a ton of sarcasm)))  But then she said "" Did he clone out those people yet, cus our Charlie and other kids would love a print on their wall and he should send a print to the museum as well, they will love it, with or without the people in it"  This is a hormonal 17.8 year old setting the bar, high  and giving you a 10 star thumbs up!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!! Cherish it!! lol Well done Mark, I am an old women and I love dinosaurs, this is a really fabulous photo that tugs at everyone heartstrings.', '2018-08-23 02:21:01.000000', NULL, 0),
